{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "d7c1a3b0-5f2e-4b8a-9c1d-shopio000001",
    "name": "Shopio API",
    "description": "Shopio marketplace REST API (v1).\n\n## Setup\n1. Set the `baseUrl` variable (default http://localhost:8000/api/v1).\n2. Run **Auth > Register** or **Auth > Login**; a test script stores `token` automatically.\n3. Bearer auth is applied collection-wide; public endpoints ignore it.\n\n## CSRF\nOnly needed if you switch to cookie sessions. In bearer mode (the default here) CSRF is not required.\n\n## Idempotency\nA collection-level pre-request script sets a fresh `idempotencyKey` (GUID) on every request; the money endpoints send it as `Idempotency-Key`. To test replay, freeze the key (uncheck the pre-request script) and send the same body twice.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      { "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Fresh idempotency key per request (freeze to test replay).",
          "pm.variables.set('idempotencyKey', pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}'));"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8000/api/v1" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "csrfToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "idempotencyKey", "value": "" },
    { "key": "productSlug", "value": "test-product" },
    { "key": "variantId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "orderId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "refundId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "payoutId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "userId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "sellerId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "cronToken", "value": "change-me" },
    { "key": "mockSecret", "value": "dev-mock-webhook-secret-change-me" }
  ],
